MermaidPocket is an independent Android app for editing and viewing
Mermaid diagram syntax. It is not Mermaid Chart and it is not the
official mermaid.js product.

The diagram engine bundled in this app is a separate work:

mermaid.js
Project: https://github.com/mermaid-js/mermaid
